{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102091","id":2813344281,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6nsDoZ","number":102091,"title":"Objects defined as inner classes cannot be sent via RPC","user":{"login":"elenakrittik","id":77104725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTA0NzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77104725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik","html_url":"https://github.com/elenakrittik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-27T15:33:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-28T14:03:10Z","closed_at":"2025-01-28T14:01:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLet's say we have a `PlayerData` object, defined as an inner class (using the `class PlayerData: ...` syntax), and an RPC function that takes it as an argument.\n\nWhen trying to call that function, Godot will not be able to properly serialize the `PlayerData`, (presumably) because it doesn't have a script path (`.get_script().resource_path` is an empty string), (presumably) because it was defined as an inner class. Consequently, the receiving side will also fail to deserialize the transmitted half-broken `PlayerData`, (presumably) because it doesn't know which object the transmitted data represents.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MRP. Open Debug > Customize Run Instances and configure it as shown here:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/111ce9e1-a9f9-4da9-8219-c00135ddc71a)\n\nRun the project. Observe the errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[netbug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18560160/netbug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"elenakrittik","id":77104725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTA0NzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77104725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik","html_url":"https://github.com/elenakrittik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elenakrittik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102091/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}